  "description": "Stampede-protected, container-scoped in-process caching for .NET, built on Microsoft.Extensions.Caching.Memory. Runs each factory once per key for all concurrent callers, keeps serving the previous value while a refresh loads, and applies per-container TTL with native LRU or hand-rolled LFU eviction.",
